# The groups developer mode offers an account (ame system dx-group), in one place for the recipe, Control
# and the security report. Each line: the group, "root" when a member can become root without the sudo
# password, or "-", and what the group lets its members do. Nothing joins anyone to them by itself.
docker root Docker without sudo. Its socket can start a container that mounts the whole system.
incus-admin root Incus without sudo. It can make privileged containers, which are root on this machine.
libvirt root Virtual machines on the system connection (qemu:///system), which can attach any disk of this machine.
dialout - Serial devices, such as microcontroller boards and USB-to-serial adapters.
wireshark - Capturing network traffic with Wireshark, without sudo.
